@beautification
title: Beautification
subtitle: “Beautify” the major streets and avenues of Saskatoon, Regina, and various small towns 

@provincial_parks
title: Expanding Provincial Parks and Conservation Areas
subtitle: Set aside land for conservation and provincial parks; develop public recreational facilities in rural areas
